== 1. a live binding names a step the job does not have
   Renaming a step is invisible to every other gate here: the failure is a
   pulse that silently never fires again.
--- OK  renamed step
    expected red, got red (exit 2)
    | python3 scripts/generate-topology.py --check
    | site-data: REFUSED
    | phase stage-apply: deploy-stage.yml job deploy has no step named 'Terraform  apply'. Renaming a step breaks the pulse silently; this is that rename, caught.
    | make: *** [Makefile:184: site-data-check] Error 1

