== 3. the environment filter is removed from the node index
   stage and prod are the same modules in two state levels and hold
   IDENTICAL member addresses. Without the filter every address maps to
   whichever node was seen last, and half the map lights from the other
   environment's cycle - which is why the stub topology carries a prod node
   holding stage's members.
